		"Malay has one plural category: every count takes the same form, and the noun does not change",
		"after a numeral (5 varian, not 5 varian-varian).",
		"Written as Malaysian Malay, not as Indonesian with a few words swapped: diskaun not diskon,",
		"imej not gambar, fail not berkas, cari not telusuri."
